<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Irish blue chip basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Irish blue chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued five million American-style call warrants, on an Irish blue chip basket comprising Allied Irish Banks Plc, Bank of Ireland, CRH Plc and Irish Life, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    8.50 STG		  PREMIUM	12.20</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.63 STG		  GEARING	12.9 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	14.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  8.14 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
